        'brat' => [
            'name' => 'Brat', 'slug' => 'brat', 'tag' => 'Fights first, yields after',
            'line' => 'You\'ll obey — but they have to earn it first. The resistance is the game.',
            'long' => 'It\'s not that you don\'t want to be led — you need proof they can actually lead you. The backtalk, the squirming away, the deliberate not-listening: all tests. And the moment you\'re pinned back down, held still, mouth covered, you\'re deeply satisfied. You\'ll still act up next time, though — the process is the whole point.',
